00:01:25,730 --> 00:01:27,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><b><font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><font color="#fff4f2">one more time</font></font></font></b></font>

31
00:01:38,910 --> 00:01:44,950
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">Assassin Under</font>

32
00:01:38,910 --> 00:01:44,950
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">the Moonlight</font>

33
00:01:54,130 --> 00:01:56,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">T-This guy...</font>

34
00:02:01,890 --> 00:02:02,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke-kun!</font>

35
00:02:05,140 --> 00:02:06,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So we were too late...</font>

36
00:02:11,360 --> 00:02:12,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Those guys...</font>

37
00:02:21,070 --> 00:02:23,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sa... Sakura-chan...?</font>

38
00:02:27,870 --> 00:02:29,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You guys...</font>

39
00:02:29,620 --> 00:02:30,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">T-This...</font>

40
00:02:31,380 --> 00:02:33,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He probably fought recklessly...</font>

41
00:02:34,880 --> 00:02:36,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">like that time!</font>

42
00:02:39,510 --> 00:02:40,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke-kun!</font>

43
00:02:41,050 --> 00:02:44,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Kakashi-sensei said there was nothing
to worry about with the bruise!</font>

44
00:02:44,760 --> 00:02:47,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So tell me... Sakura-chan...</font>

45
00:02:48,060 --> 00:02:49,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sakura-chan!</font>

46
00:02:49,940 --> 00:02:50,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What do you want?!</font>

47
00:02:52,110 --> 00:02:54,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This guy... Who is he?!</font>

48
00:02:55,690 --> 00:02:58,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">His outward appearance
is different, but...</font>

49
00:02:59,400 --> 00:03:01,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">he's that guy called Gaara.</font>

50
00:03:03,320 --> 00:03:07,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">When I came into this world, I took the life
of the woman some might call my mother.</font>

51
00:03:08,250 --> 00:03:10,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So that I could become
the strongest Shinobi...</font>

52
00:03:10,540 --> 00:03:13,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">my father brought his Ninjutsu upon me,</font>

53
00:03:13,210 --> 00:03:15,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and so I became possessed
by a Sand Spirit.</font>

54
00:03:16,340 --> 00:03:18,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I was born a monster.</font>

55
00:03:20,550 --> 00:03:23,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So that's what he was saying...</font>

56
00:03:23,550 --> 00:03:26,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's the one who hurt Sasuke-kun...</font>

57
00:03:26,220 --> 00:03:27,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, young girl!</font>

58
00:03:28,390 --> 00:03:31,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I want you to know that
I'm not the fighting type!</font>

59
00:03:31,730 --> 00:03:33,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I can see that by looking at you!</font>

60
00:03:35,860 --> 00:03:37,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In any case,
I need to get away from here</font>

61
00:03:37,780 --> 00:03:41,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and somehow take Sasuke-kun to
where Kakashi-sensei is!</font>

62
00:03:44,530 --> 00:03:45,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You...</font>

63
00:03:48,410 --> 00:03:49,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke-kun...!</font>

64
00:03:50,000 --> 00:03:52,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well! Your limit is two shots...</font>

65
00:03:53,830 --> 00:03:55,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's about it...</font>

66
00:03:56,210 --> 00:04:00,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The third shot won't be activated...
Remember this well.</font>

67
00:04:02,260 --> 00:04:04,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you try to force a Jutsu to activate...</font>

68
00:04:04,590 --> 00:04:07,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">not only will the Jutsu
not properly activate,</font>

69
00:04:07,140 --> 00:04:09,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">but your Chakra will deplete to zero...</font>

70
00:04:09,520 --> 00:04:12,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and in the worst case, you'll die!</font>

71
00:04:18,440 --> 00:04:24,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Even if you were to survive,
absolutely nothing good will come of it.</font>

72
00:04:25,410 --> 00:04:27,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Especially in your case...</font>

73
00:04:28,450 --> 00:04:29,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Is it the Curse Mark...?</font>

74
00:04:35,120 --> 00:04:36,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you let your hatred take over you,</font>

75
00:04:36,830 --> 00:04:39,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and rely on the power
of the Curse Mark...</font>

76
00:04:39,670 --> 00:04:42,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">your development will stop there.</font>

77
00:04:43,220 --> 00:04:46,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If that happens, you won't
be able to beat Itachi.</font>

78
00:04:48,390 --> 00:04:51,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In any case,
I need to get control over this.</font>

79
00:04:53,560 --> 00:04:54,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke-kun!</font>

80
00:04:55,770 --> 00:04:57,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I see you're...</font>

81
00:04:58,860 --> 00:05:01,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">the one I failed to kill that time.</font>

82
00:05:02,990 --> 00:05:07,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I live fighting for only myself
and loving myself...</font>

83
00:05:07,740 --> 00:05:10,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And as long as there are others to kill...</font>

84
00:05:10,950 --> 00:05:13,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I will never disappear.</font>

85
00:05:15,460 --> 00:05:18,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">L-Let's run! Everyone!</font>

86
00:05:32,470 --> 00:05:34,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Die! Uchiha Sasuke!</font>

87
00:05:38,940 --> 00:05:40,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sakura-chan!</font>

88
00:05:51,660 --> 00:05:53,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Out of the way!</font>

89
00:06:09,590 --> 00:06:10,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sakura-chan!</font>

90
00:06:14,430 --> 00:06:16,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">How could she stand
in the way of that Gaara...?</font>

91
00:06:17,940 --> 00:06:23,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn! Damn!
What the hell should we do?!</font>

92
00:06:26,820 --> 00:06:28,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Just with him, I don't want to...</font>

93
00:06:29,410 --> 00:06:31,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Now, let me feel it!</font>

94
00:06:41,170 --> 00:06:42,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why...?</font>

95
00:06:50,130 --> 00:06:52,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Gaara-sama, Please calm down.</font>

96
00:07:08,320 --> 00:07:09,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's no use after all...</font>

97
00:07:10,860 --> 00:07:12,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The sand gets in the way.</font>

98
00:07:13,950 --> 00:07:15,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Gaara-sama...</font>

99
00:07:16,330 --> 00:07:17,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yashamaru!</font>

100
00:07:18,580 --> 00:07:20,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I may not look it,</font>

101
00:07:20,370 --> 00:07:23,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">but Kazekage-sama charged me
to look after your physical condition</font>

102
00:07:23,250 --> 00:07:25,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">as a member of medical corps
and to be with you.</font>

103
00:07:26,380 --> 00:07:29,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Please do not do such things
in front of me.</font>

104
00:07:31,720 --> 00:07:34,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Although the sand will protect you...</font>

105
00:07:38,270 --> 00:07:40,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yashamaru... I'm sorry...</font>

106
00:07:42,100 --> 00:07:45,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh, this..? It's just a scrape.</font>

107
00:07:48,610 --> 00:07:49,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A scrape...</font>

108
00:07:50,950 --> 00:07:51,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Is it painful?</font>

109
00:07:54,160 --> 00:07:57,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A little bit... But it'll heal in no time.</font>

110
00:08:06,420 --> 00:08:07,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, Yashamaru...</font>

111
00:08:07,920 --> 00:08:09,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What is it?</font>

112
00:08:09,800 --> 00:08:11,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What is pain?</font>

113
00:08:14,930 --> 00:08:18,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I've... never once had a wound so...</font>

114
00:08:19,100 --> 00:08:21,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I wondered what it's like...</font>

115
00:08:22,390 --> 00:08:23,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well...</font>

116
00:08:24,310 --> 00:08:26,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">How can I explain it?</font>

117
00:08:27,570 --> 00:08:30,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's like it's distressing, or difficult...</font>

118
00:08:31,690 --> 00:08:34,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In other words, to be hit or cut...</font>

119
00:08:34,490 --> 00:08:38,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Maybe I should say it's a feeling
of not being able to bear it,</font>

120
00:08:38,580 --> 00:08:40,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">of not being able to stay normal...</font>

121
00:08:41,580 --> 00:08:43,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I can't say it well,</font>

122
00:08:43,210 --> 00:08:46,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">but I suppose it means a situation
that's not very good.</font>

123
00:08:58,970 --> 00:09:00,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yashamaru...</font>

124
00:09:00,470 --> 00:09:01,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes?</font>

125
00:09:02,480 --> 00:09:08,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So, do you dislike me... Yashamaru?</font>

126
00:09:19,870 --> 00:09:24,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">People live their lives while
hurting others and while being hurt.</font>

127
00:09:24,710 --> 00:09:28,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But it's not so easy for
people to dislike others.</font>

128
00:09:31,460 --> 00:09:33,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Thank you, Yashamaru.</font>

129
00:09:34,380 --> 00:09:37,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I think I sort of understand
what pain is now.</font>

130
00:09:37,890 --> 00:09:38,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I see...</font>

131
00:09:41,310 --> 00:09:46,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So... maybe I'm injured too?
The same as everyone?</font>

132
00:09:47,310 --> 00:09:49,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm always... in pain.</font>

133
00:09:50,820 --> 00:09:52,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm not bleeding, but...</font>

134
00:09:52,530 --> 00:09:55,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I've been having a lot of
pain around... here.</font>

135
00:10:17,680 --> 00:10:20,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Blood does flow from a wound
on the body</font>

136
00:10:20,850 --> 00:10:22,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and the wound may appear painful.</font>

137
00:10:22,970 --> 00:10:26,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But as time passes, the pain
naturally disappears.</font>

138
00:10:26,640 --> 00:10:29,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">By using medicine,
the healing is even faster.</font>

139
00:10:30,650 --> 00:10:33,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But what's dangerous is
a wound of the heart.</font>

140
00:10:33,650 --> 00:10:36,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Nothing has more trouble healing.</font>

141
00:10:37,240 --> 00:10:38,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A wound of the heart?</font>

142
00:10:38,900 --> 00:10:42,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A wound on the body and
a wound of the heart are slightly different.</font>

143
00:10:42,990 --> 00:10:46,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Unlike a wound on the body,
there is no ointment and sometimes,</font>

144
00:10:46,410 --> 00:10:48,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">it doesn't heal for one's entire life.</font>

145
00:10:55,840 --> 00:10:59,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But there is one thing that
can cure a wound of the heart.</font>

146
00:11:01,470 --> 00:11:03,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">However, this is a complicated medicine.</font>

147
00:11:04,050 --> 00:11:06,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It can only be given to you
by another person.</font>

148
00:11:06,680 --> 00:11:09,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What? What must I do to...?</font>

149
00:11:10,100 --> 00:11:12,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The thing that can cure
a wound of the heart.</font>

150
00:11:13,110 --> 00:11:14,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That is...</font>

151
00:11:17,070 --> 00:11:18,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">love.</font>

152
00:11:19,030 --> 00:11:20,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Love?</font>

153
00:11:20,610 --> 00:11:21,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes.</font>

154
00:11:21,610 --> 00:11:26,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">H-How can I get it?
What do I need to do for this pain to be...?</font>

155
00:11:26,870 --> 00:11:30,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It has already been given to you, Gaara-sama.</font>

156
00:11:30,540 --> 00:11:31,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?</font>

157
00:11:35,340 --> 00:11:40,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Love is... a heart that desires to serve
a precious person who is close to oneself,</font>

158
00:11:40,130 --> 00:11:44,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">to love and watch over that person,
just like my older sister did.</font>

159
00:11:45,430 --> 00:11:49,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I believe that my older sister
loved you, Gaara-sama.</font>

160
00:11:50,430 --> 00:11:54,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sand Spirit Shukaku is a spirit of a living
person used for the purpose of attacks.</font>

161
00:11:55,610 --> 00:12:00,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The sand which automatically tries to
protect you is like the love of a mother.</font>

162
00:12:01,740 --> 00:12:06,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I believe that sand is filled
with your mother's will.</font>

163
00:12:07,950 --> 00:12:13,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">My sister... probably wanted to
protect you even more after dying...</font>

164
00:12:16,750 --> 00:12:18,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yashamaru...</font>

165
00:12:18,840 --> 00:12:19,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What is it?</font>

166
00:12:20,840 --> 00:12:24,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Thanks for what you did earlier...
for stopping me.</font>

167
00:12:25,680 --> 00:12:27,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You are welcome.</font>

168
00:12:28,350 --> 00:12:32,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You are a precious person
who is near me, Gaara-sama!</font>

169
00:12:55,710 --> 00:12:59,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Can you understand... my pain?</font>

170
00:13:09,010 --> 00:13:10,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It tastes like iron...</font>

171
00:14:24,340 --> 00:14:25,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Twenty!</font>

172
00:14:32,470 --> 00:14:34,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Twenty-one!</font>

173
00:14:48,700 --> 00:14:52,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Leaf... Hurricane!</font>

174
00:14:55,540 --> 00:14:57,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">How many did you take
down Kakashi?</font>

175
00:14:57,960 --> 00:14:59,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Twenty-two.</font>

176
00:15:00,250 --> 00:15:02,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh, it seems I win again!</font>

177
00:15:04,960 --> 00:15:07,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That was my twenty-third.</font>

178
00:15:07,510 --> 00:15:09,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah, yeah all right...</font>

179
00:15:09,880 --> 00:15:12,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That poser attitude of yours
still makes you cool!</font>

180
00:15:12,800 --> 00:15:14,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's the reason you are my rival!</font>

181
00:15:15,810 --> 00:15:17,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Let's go!
— All right!</font>

182
00:15:33,370 --> 00:15:36,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, Yashamaru...
I have a favor to ask!</font>

183
00:15:37,490 --> 00:15:38,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What is it?</font>

184
00:15:40,000 --> 00:15:41,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I want some ointment.</font>

185
00:15:51,510 --> 00:15:54,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sorry about earlier...
It must've hurt.</font>

186
00:15:55,100 --> 00:15:57,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is medicine.</font>

187
00:15:57,600 --> 00:15:58,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you want it...</font>

188
00:15:58,560 --> 00:16:00,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Go home... freak!</font>

189
00:16:31,340 --> 00:16:33,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh, what the...?!</font>

190
00:16:33,180 --> 00:16:35,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, be careful, you brat...</font>

191
00:16:35,590 --> 00:16:37,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Y-You are...</font>

192
00:16:39,930 --> 00:16:42,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Again...
— Go home, freak!</font>

193
00:16:42,770 --> 00:16:43,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">These eyes...</font>

194
00:16:43,730 --> 00:16:45,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Y-You are...</font>

195
00:16:45,770 --> 00:16:48,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why...? Why?!</font>

196
00:16:48,820 --> 00:16:50,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">H-Hey!</font>

197
00:16:56,990 --> 00:16:58,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What the...? What's going on?</font>

198
00:16:58,490 --> 00:16:59,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's... it's Gaara!</font>

199
00:16:59,790 --> 00:17:02,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey! This guy's dead.</font>

200
00:17:18,390 --> 00:17:19,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Father...</font>

201
00:17:32,860 --> 00:17:35,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">As I thought... Things don't go well...</font>

202
00:17:39,910 --> 00:17:43,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why is it... that only I'm such a freak?!</font>

203
00:17:45,080 --> 00:17:47,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What... am I?!</font>

204
00:17:48,830 --> 00:17:52,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The thing that can cure
a wound of the heart is love.</font>

205
00:17:54,010 --> 00:17:55,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yashamaru!</font>

206
00:18:15,070 --> 00:18:16,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?</font>

207
00:18:20,200 --> 00:18:23,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why? Why me...?</font>

208
00:18:23,700 --> 00:18:25,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why always me?!</font>

209
00:18:51,100 --> 00:18:54,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Who...? Why...?</font>

210
00:19:30,350 --> 00:19:33,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well done... Gaara-sama.</font>

211
00:19:41,360 --> 00:19:43,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yashamaru...!</font>

212
00:19:54,670 --> 00:19:55,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's those eyes...</font>

213
00:19:59,130 --> 00:20:02,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's the matter?
Weren't you gonna run away?</font>

214
00:20:04,970 --> 00:20:06,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke-kun...</font>

215
00:20:08,220 --> 00:20:09,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto...</font>

216
00:20:13,230 --> 00:20:18,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What are these two... to you?!</font>

217
00:20:20,530 --> 00:20:25,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">T-These two are... my friends!</font>

218
00:20:26,410 --> 00:20:29,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Try laying so much as
another finger on them!</font>

219
00:20:29,660 --> 00:20:31,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll beat you up!</font>

220
00:20:40,210 --> 00:20:44,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So... what's the matter?!
Weren't you gonna beat me up?</font>

221
00:20:47,430 --> 00:20:48,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hurry up and come at me...</font>

222
00:20:55,600 --> 00:20:57,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn it!</font>

223
00:21:05,260 --> 00:21:16,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">dare datte shippai wa surunda hazukashii koto janai</font></font></font></font>

224
00:21:05,260 --> 00:21:16,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">everyone makes mistakes it's nothing to be ashamed about</font></font></font></font>

225
00:21:16,050 --> 00:21:27,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">kono kizu o muda ni shinai de waratte arukereba ii</font></font></font></font>

226
00:21:16,050 --> 00:21:27,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">don't let this scar be for naught walk with a smile</font></font></font></font>

227
00:21:37,330 --> 00:21:42,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">sou shizuka na kuuki suikomi hiroki sora ni kao age tobikomi</font></font></font></font>

228
00:21:37,330 --> 00:21:42,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">yes, breathe in the air and lift your face to the sky and jump</font></font></font></font>

229
00:21:42,930 --> 00:21:48,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">toki ni ame ga futtara hito yasumi jaa yukusaki wa kaze fuku mama ni</font></font></font></font>

230
00:21:42,930 --> 00:21:48,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">if it rains, take a break go where the wind takes you</font></font></font></font>

231
00:21:48,130 --> 00:21:53,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">takusan no matotteru koukai kono kizu o muda ni shicha shounai</font></font></font></font>

232
00:21:48,130 --> 00:21:53,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">so many regrets don't let this scar be for naught</font></font></font></font>

233
00:21:53,340 --> 00:21:56,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">ude ni kunshou kizami ikoukai shougai</font></font></font></font>

234
00:21:53,340 --> 00:21:56,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">let's go carve the in our chest</font></font></font></font>

235
00:21:56,970 --> 00:21:58,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">sou kokkara ga SHOW TIME</font></font></font></font>

236
00:21:56,970 --> 00:21:58,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">yes, it's show time, life begins now.</font></font></font></font>

237
00:21:58,480 --> 00:22:08,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">dare datte shippai wa surunda hazukashii koto janai</font></font></font></font>

238
00:21:58,480 --> 00:22:08,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">everyone makes mistakes It's nothing to be ashamed about</font></font></font></font>

239
00:22:08,950 --> 00:22:19,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">kono kizu o muda ni shinai de waratte arukereba ii</font></font></font></font>

240
00:22:08,950 --> 00:22:19,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">don't let this scar be for naught walk with a smile</font></font></font></font>

241
00:22:19,500 --> 00:22:29,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">kanashimi mo kaze ni kaete tsuyoku susunde ikereba ii</font></font></font></font>

242
00:22:19,500 --> 00:22:29,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">transform sadness into the wind and continue to forge on</font></font></font></font>

243
00:22:29,790 --> 00:22:35,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">tsuyoku susunde ikereba ii</font></font></font></font>

244
00:22:29,790 --> 00:22:35,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">forge on strong</font></font></font></font>

245
00:22:47,510 --> 00:22:49,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I know this guy's strength.</font>

246
00:22:50,050 --> 00:22:54,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I may seem like a senseless
weakling to him.</font>

247
00:22:55,720 --> 00:23:00,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But... what's...?
What's this feeling welling up inside me?</font>

248
00:23:01,100 --> 00:23:02,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I don't know...</font>

249
00:23:02,440 --> 00:23:09,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I don't know,
but I just don't want to lose to this guy!</font>

250
00:23:09,780 --> 00:23:13,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Next time:
"Light vs Dark: The Two Faces of Gaara"</font>

